    "contentHtml": "\u003Cp>After making major design or content changes, you might want new screenshots for your pages.\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Sign in to Mosaic\u003C/strong> and go to \u003Cstrong>Websites\u003C/strong>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Open the actions for the site and choose \u003Cstrong>Refresh OG Images\u003C/strong>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Confirm the action. All previously cached images will be deleted.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Visit your pages again to trigger creation of fresh OG images.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cp>Refreshing ensures your previews always match the latest version of your site.\u003C/p>\n",
