    "contentHtml": "\u003Ch1>Managing Your Subscription\u003C/h1>\n\u003Cp>Mosaic offers flexible subscription plans to meet your needs. Here’s how to\nmanage your subscription.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2>Available Plans\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3>Free Plan\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>500 OG images per month\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Unlimited websites\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Community forum support\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>Pro Plan ($19/month)\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>5,000 OG images per month\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Priority email support\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Advanced analytics\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>Pro Yearly Plan ($199/year)\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Unlimited OG images\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Unlimited websites\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Priority email support\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Advanced analytics\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Custom branding options\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Save $29 compared to monthly billing\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2>Upgrading Your Plan\u003C/h2>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Navigate to your \u003Cstrong>Settings\u003C/strong> page\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>In the “Plan &amp; Billing” section, click the \u003Cstrong>Upgrade\u003C/strong> button for your\ndesired plan\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Complete the secure checkout process\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Your plan will be activated immediately after payment\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch2>Managing Your Subscription\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Once you have a Pro plan, you can manage your subscription through the customer\nportal:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to your \u003Cstrong>Settings\u003C/strong> page\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Manage Subscription\u003C/strong> on your current plan\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>This will open the customer portal where you can:\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Update your payment method\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Download invoices\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Cancel your subscription\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch2>Canceling Your Subscription\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>You can cancel your subscription at any time:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Access the customer portal (see above)\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Cancel Subscription\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>You’ll continue to have Pro access until the end of your current billing\nperiod\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch2>Billing and Invoices\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>All payments are processed securely through our payment provider\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Invoices are available in the customer portal\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Failed payments will result in service downgrade to the free plan\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2>Need Help?\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>If you have questions about billing or subscriptions, contact our support team\nat hello@praveenjuge.com.\u003C/p>\n",
