    "category": "Authentication",
    "contentHtml": "\u003Cp>If you need to change your password on Mosaicimg.com, follow these simple steps:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Visit the Website\u003C/strong>\u003Cbr>\nGo to \u003Ca href=\"https://mosaicimg.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">mosaicimg.com\u003C/a> using your preferred web browser.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Sign In\u003C/strong>\u003Cbr>\nClick on the \u003Cstrong>“Sign In”\u003C/strong> button located at the homepage.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Enter Your Email\u003C/strong>\u003Cbr>\nIn the sign-in window, enter your email address associated with your account, and then click \u003Cstrong>Enter\u003C/strong>.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Forgot Password?\u003C/strong>\u003Cbr>\nIf you don’t remember your password, click on the \u003Cstrong>“Forgot Password”\u003C/strong> link next to the password field.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Follow the Instructions\u003C/strong>\u003Cbr>\nYou will receive an email with a code or link to reset your password. Follow the instructions provided in the email to set a new password.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Complete the Process\u003C/strong>\u003Cbr>\nOnce you’ve successfully changed your password, you will be redirected to your dashboard, where you can continue using Mosaic.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>By following these steps, you can easily change your password and regain access to your account.\u003C/p>\n",
